    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτόφι</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔτο-φιν</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 case-forms of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτός,</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> always with Prep., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽
		αὐτόφιν</span> from <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				very spot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.44
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ αὐτόφιν</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				12.302
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.42
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐτόφιν</span> on
				<i>the spot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				19.255
			</span></i>.</div>
